%% F2 Walk-in (SDD §6 F2; cut-offs judged at the scan)
flowchart TD
  A["Scans gate QR, GPS,<br/>signs in (+ profile)"] --> B["Finds host by room,<br/>visit type, live photo"]
  B --> C{"Rules at<br/>scan time?"}
  C -- refused --> X["Rule message"]
  C -- ok --> D["Host notified<br/>(SMS after 60 s)"]
  D --> E{"Host decides<br/>within 10 min?"}
  E -- approves --> F["Inside; guest<br/>screen turns green"]
  E -- "rejects / timeout" --> Y["Rejected /<br/>expired"]
